    "detailed_description": "<h1>Notice:</h1><p><strong>VIDEO GAME is local multiplayer only, for 2 OR 4 players.<br>Requires a controller for each player.<br>There is no single player content.</strong></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1>VIDEO GAME is a local-multiplayer action arcade game. Curve the ball past your opponents and dash to save a goal at the last second!<br><br>With simple one-button controls, anyone can pick up and play. Aim and shoot the ball past your opponent to score and dash to catch and return it quickly for a stronger shot. Fight your friend 1v1, or team up and battle in a frantic 2v2 match!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Key Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>\t1v1 or 2v2 matches!</li></ul>Thrash your mate in a 1v1 match, or pass the ball to your teammate and work together in 2v2 matches!<br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>\tCustomisation!</li></ul>Every player can choose a colour and face, adjust point values and play on one of 4 levels!<br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>\tMusic!</li></ul>Two toe-tappingly Dope Tracks!",
